;; M4N slice 1 refusal: the edited relation is read BOTH positively and
;; negatively in the cone; slice 1's finalize-upfront vehicle requires the
;; changed negated relation's cone reads to be exactly negative.

table (a int)
table (b int)
table (m int)
table (h int)

rule
(b X)
-->
(m X)

rule
(a X)
~(b X)
-->
(h X)
